---
import {
  planarDipolePotentialStep,
  slabDipoleImageEnergy,
} from '../../../data/part07/ewaldCoulombModel.mjs';

const defaultSigma = 0.08;
const defaultSeparation = 2.0;
const defaultCellLength = 12;
const area = 1;
const defaultDipole = defaultSigma * area * defaultSeparation;
const defaultStep = planarDipolePotentialStep({
  surfaceChargeDensity: defaultSigma,
  separation: defaultSeparation,
});
const defaultImage = slabDipoleImageEnergy({
  dipoleMoment: defaultDipole,
  area,
  cellLength: defaultCellLength,
});
const fallbackRows = [8, 12, 20].map((cellLength) => ({
  cellLength,
  energy: slabDipoleImageEnergy({ dipoleMoment: defaultDipole, area, cellLength }),
}));
---

<figure class="chapter-visual slab-dipole" data-slab-dipole>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：平面偶极势阶跃与周期 slab 镜像能</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: planar dipole potential step and periodic-slab image energy</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls slab-dipole__controls">
    <label>
      <span>sheet charge density σ | 面电荷密度</span>
      <input type="range" min="0.02" max="0.15" step="0.01" value={defaultSigma} data-slab-sigma />
      <output data-slab-sigma-output>{defaultSigma.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>sheet separation d | 偶极层间距</span>
      <input type="range" min="0.5" max="4" step="0.1" value={defaultSeparation} data-slab-separation />
      <output data-slab-separation-output>{defaultSeparation.toFixed(1)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>periodic cell length Lz | 周期长度</span>
      <input type="range" min="6" max="30" step="1" value={defaultCellLength} data-slab-cell />
      <output data-slab-cell-output>{defaultCellLength.toFixed(0)}</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 820 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="slab-title slab-desc">
    <title id="slab-title">Potential step of two charged planes and inverse-cell-length image energy</title>
    <desc id="slab-desc">
      Two oppositely charged infinite planes form a neutral dipole layer. The electric field is nonzero only between the sheets and creates a potential step with magnitude four pi sigma d. A separate curve shows the leading periodic dipole image energy decreasing as one over the cell length Lz.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="slab-arrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="8" refY="4.5" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 z" class="slab-dipole__arrowhead" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g transform="translate(35 35)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="365" height="245" rx="12" class="slab-dipole__panel" />
      <text x="182" y="28" text-anchor="middle">planar-averaged electrostatics</text>
      <line x1="85" y1="70" x2="85" y2="207" class="slab-dipole__positive-sheet" data-slab-positive-sheet />
      <line x1="280" y1="70" x2="280" y2="207" class="slab-dipole__negative-sheet" data-slab-negative-sheet />
      <text x="85" y="224" text-anchor="middle">+σ</text>
      <text x="280" y="224" text-anchor="middle">−σ</text>
      <line x1="98" y1="122" x2="267" y2="122" marker-end="url(#slab-arrow)" class="slab-dipole__field" />
      <text x="182" y="108" text-anchor="middle">E = 4πσ</text>
      <polyline points="30,184 85,184 280,85 335,85" class="slab-dipole__potential" data-slab-potential />
      <text x="182" y="58" text-anchor="middle">|ΔV| = 4πσd</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(445 35)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="340" height="245" rx="12" class="slab-dipole__panel" />
      <text x="170" y="28" text-anchor="middle">periodic image interaction</text>
      <line x1="48" y1="207" x2="305" y2="207" class="plot-axis" />
      <line x1="48" y1="55" x2="48" y2="207" class="plot-axis" />
      <path d="M 48 61 C 95 100, 160 145, 305 190" class="plot-curve" />
      <line x1="112" y1="55" x2="112" y2="207" class="slab-dipole__probe" data-slab-probe />
      <text x="305" y="232" text-anchor="end">Lz</text>
      <text x="18" y="65">Eimg</text>
      <text x="170" y="46" text-anchor="middle">Eimg = 2πp²/(A Lz)</text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout slab-dipole__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>dipole p=σAd</span><strong data-slab-dipole>{defaultDipole.toFixed(5)}</strong>
    <span>|ΔV|</span><strong data-slab-step>{defaultStep.toFixed(6)}</strong>
    <span>periodic image energy</span><strong data-slab-image>{defaultImage.toExponential(5)}</strong>
    <span>Lz·Eimg</span><strong data-slab-scaled>{(defaultCellLength * defaultImage).toExponential(5)}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="slab-dipole__fallback">
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript 参考表 | No-JavaScript reference table</strong></p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Lz</th><th>Eimg</th><th>Lz·Eimg</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {fallbackRows.map((row) => (
          <tr>
            <td>{row.cellLength.toFixed(0)}</td>
            <td>{row.energy.toExponential(6)}</td>
            <td>{(row.cellLength * row.energy).toExponential(6)}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>面积 <code>A=1</code> 的两张无限平面带 <code>+σ</code> 与 <code>−σ</code>，间距 <code>d</code>；Gaussian/atomic electrostatic units。neutral dipole moment 为 <code>p=σAd</code>，势阶跃取 magnitude <code>|ΔV|=4πσd</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> two infinite planes of area <code>A=1</code> carry <code>+σ</code> and <code>−σ</code> at separation <code>d</code> in Gaussian/atomic electrostatic units. The neutral dipole moment is <code>p=σAd</code> and the potential-step magnitude is <code>|ΔV|=4πσd</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>势阶跃与 d、σ 线性；三维周期 tin-foil slab 的 leading dipole image energy 按 <code>1/Lz</code> 衰减，故 <code>Lz·Eimg</code> 保持常数。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the potential step is linear in d and σ; the leading dipole image energy of a three-dimensionally periodic tin-foil slab decays as <code>1/Lz</code>, so <code>Lz·Eimg</code> remains constant.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该 correction 只代表中性 slab 的 leading dipole term。charged slabs、finite dielectric、2D Coulomb cutoff、quadrupoles、metal screening 和 asymmetric boundary 需要不同处理。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> this correction represents only the leading neutral-slab dipole term. Charged slabs, finite dielectrics, two-dimensional Coulomb cutoffs, quadrupoles, metallic screening, and asymmetric boundaries require different treatments.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import {
    planarDipolePotentialStep,
    slabDipoleImageEnergy,
  } from '../../../data/part07/ewaldCoulombModel.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-slab-dipole]').forEach((root) => {
    const sigmaInput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-sigma]');
    const separationInput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-separation]');
    const cellInput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-cell]');
    const sigmaOutput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-sigma-output]');
    const separationOutput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-separation-output]');
    const cellOutput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-cell-output]');
    const dipoleOutput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-dipole]');
    const stepOutput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-step]');
    const imageOutput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-image]');
    const scaledOutput = root.querySelector('[data-slab-scaled]');
    const negativeSheet = root.querySelector('[data-slab-negative-sheet]');
    const potential = root.querySelector('[data-slab-potential]');
    const probe = root.querySelector('[data-slab-probe]');
    if (!(sigmaInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)
      || !(separationInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)
      || !(cellInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;

    const update = () => {
      const sigma = Number(sigmaInput.value);
      const separation = Number(separationInput.value);
      const cellLength = Number(cellInput.value);
      const dipole = sigma * separation;
      const step = planarDipolePotentialStep({ surfaceChargeDensity: sigma, separation });
      const image = slabDipoleImageEnergy({ dipoleMoment: dipole, area: 1, cellLength });
      const sheetX = 85 + 195 * (separation - 0.5) / 3.5;
      if (negativeSheet instanceof SVGLineElement) {
        negativeSheet.setAttribute('x1', sheetX.toFixed(2));
        negativeSheet.setAttribute('x2', sheetX.toFixed(2));
      }
      if (potential instanceof SVGPolylineElement) {
        potential.setAttribute('points', `30,184 85,184 ${sheetX.toFixed(2)},85 335,85`);
      }
      if (probe instanceof SVGLineElement) {
        const x = 48 + 257 * (cellLength - 6) / 24;
        probe.setAttribute('x1', x.toFixed(2));
        probe.setAttribute('x2', x.toFixed(2));
      }
      if (sigmaOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) sigmaOutput.value = sigma.toFixed(2);
      if (separationOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) separationOutput.value = separation.toFixed(1);
      if (cellOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) cellOutput.value = cellLength.toFixed(0);
      if (dipoleOutput instanceof HTMLElement) dipoleOutput.textContent = dipole.toFixed(5);
      if (stepOutput instanceof HTMLElement) stepOutput.textContent = step.toFixed(6);
      if (imageOutput instanceof HTMLElement) imageOutput.textContent = image.toExponential(5);
      if (scaledOutput instanceof HTMLElement) scaledOutput.textContent = (cellLength * image).toExponential(5);
    };
    sigmaInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    separationInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    cellInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .slab-dipole { overflow-x: auto; }
  .slab-dipole svg { width: 100%; min-width: 46rem; }
  .slab-dipole text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .slab-dipole__panel { fill: var(--sl-color-gray-6); stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4); stroke-width: 2; }
  .slab-dipole__positive-sheet { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); stroke-width: 6; }
  .slab-dipole__negative-sheet { stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 6; }
  .slab-dipole__field { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); stroke-width: 2; }
  .slab-dipole__arrowhead { fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .slab-dipole__potential { fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2.5; }
  .slab-dipole__probe { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .slab-dipole__controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .slab-dipole__controls label { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .slab-dipole__readout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(10rem, 1fr)); gap: 0.4rem 1rem; }
  .slab-dipole__fallback { max-width: 34rem; }
</style>
